      "description": "Broadcast Solutions - Newsroom Automation & Live Graphics | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Solutions Media and Entertainment Tell More Engaging Stories to Any Audience on Any Screen Deliver captivating stories that inform and entertain any audience, across all digital and linear channels. Be first to air and keep viewers engaged, informed, and loyal with powerful, easy-to-use live production tools. Contact Sales Explore Use Cases Supporting 6,600+ companies globally Benefits Use Cases Products Case Studies Solution Areas Resources Benefits Immerse Viewers in Your Story, on Any Device 01 Engage and Grow Your Audience Connect with viewers on a deeper level. Transform complex data into compelling visuals and create interactive experiences that turn passive viewers into loyal fans, boosting engagement across every platform. 02 Be First to Air, Every Time When news breaks, speed and accuracy are everything. Our streamlined workflows empower your team to create and deliver up-to-the-minute stories with templated graphics and live data, ensuring you always lead the conversation. 03 Deliver Flawless, Reliable Broadcasts News never stops, and neither do our tools. Built for reliability and ease of use, Vizrt solutions provide the stable foundation you need for flawless performance, supported by our expert team 24/7. Use Cases Solutions for Every Workflow Graphics Design, manage, and playout immersive graphics that clarify stories and captivate audiences Read more Studio Transform studio storytelling using dynamic video walls, AR graphics, and precise automation control Read more Newsroom and PCR Be first to air with streamlined workflows, data-driven graphics, and reliable automation Read more Live Production and Vision Mixing Scale from small shows to primetime with powerful switching, automation, and real-time graphics Read more Remote and Cloud Live Productions Produce from anywhere, scale instantly, and reduce costs with cloud-hosted workflows Read more Master Control Room Centralized control of graphics and channel branding management and rendering, media asset management, Read more Products Designed for Modern News & Entertainment Workflows Data-Driven Graphics Studio/Virtual Studio Production Live Production and Vision Mixing Media Asset Management Cloud and Hybrid Workflows Audience Engagement Create stunning visuals, dynamic branding, and immersive graphics to captivate audiences and elevate storytelling. Viz Artist AI Powered Bring your creative vision to life without compromise. Design engaging motion graphics, AR, and virtual sets in real time, so you can move faster from concept to on-air viewer experience. Learn more Viz Trio Viz Trio is built for speed, flexibility, and precision, helping operators manage, edit, and play out real-time graphics and video from a single, intuitive interface, from the control room or in the cloud. Learn more Viz Ticker Viz Ticker is the industry's most comprehensive solution for creating, controlling, and broadcasting automated 3D ticker graphics. Deliver a constant stream of information—from breaking news and sports scores to financial data and social media updates—with unparalleled reliability and visual quality. Learn more Viz Pilot Edge Templated HTML-based graphics platform designed for modern newsrooms. With Viz Pilot Edge, journalists can independently create and publish graphics including data-driven overlays directly from their browsers to tell the full story. With role-based access for added security. Learn more Viz World Viz World is the industry-standard tool for creating branded, high-quality 3D maps and geographic animations. Tell clearer stories and give your audience context by visualizing locations, data, and events on a global, national, and local scale with stunning accuracy. Learn more Viz Channel Branding Stop audiences \"zapping\" away and keep them engaged and loyal with automated and scalable branding, promo, and channel cross-promotion across all linear, FAST, VOD, and OTT channels. Effortlessly automate graphic elements, promos, and alerts for a seamless viewer experience, while maintaining total control over your network’s identify. Learn more Viz Engine AI Powered The most versatile real-time 3D graphics rendering and compositing engine. It’s the creative powerhouse bringing visual storytellers’ boldest ideas to life. Learn more Case Studies Real-World Results with Vizrt “We no longer follow the model of one-to-many, where you transmit something and wait for feedback […] Now, you get the interaction immediately. This changes everything.” Fadi Radi Chief Creative Officer, blinx Fadi Radi Chief Creative Officer, blinx Read Case Study \"Thanks to the exceptional supportive team at Vizrt, we’ve been able to overcome many challenges while training a brand-new team on such an advanced suite of products.\" John van de Molengraft Director of Broadcast Technology and Operations, tastylive John van de Molengraft Director of Broadcast Technology and Operations, tastylive Read Case Study “We looked at just about every single vision mixer in the cloud and landed on TriCaster Vectar. It was important for us to have a solution that would reduce complexity and Vectar gave us better control options to build a completely virtualized production center.” Mike Buetsch Director of Broadcast Engineering and Production, Chess.com Mike Buetsch Director of Broadcast Engineering and Production, Chess.com Read Case Study “The TriCaster truly is a “plug-and-play” and “set-and-forget” system that worked seamlessly with Viz Mosart.” Jun Ye Graphics and Automation Technology Manager, 9News Jun Ye Graphics and Automation Technology Manager, 9News Read Case Study “This was our third election cycle of using Vizrt to drive data graphics. We can crunch and visualize a lot of data very quickly. We use elections to set the standard of where we want our graphics, design, and augmented reality capability",
