      "description": "TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) | 4K Cloud-Based Live Production | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Which TriCaster® is right for you? Take the Quiz Products Products TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) Anywhere-access to enterprise-grade 4K switching in the cloud that helps content creators address the ever-growing need to engage viewers and make their experience unforgettable. (formerly TriCaster Vectar) Contact Sales Tech Specs Benefits Features Case Studies FAQs Related Products Benefits The Vizrt Advantages 01 Format Flexibility Bring to life any type of live production with multi-format processing, built-in media players, recording, streaming, audio, and graphics control. TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) masters the art of reaching more audiences with aspect ratio, resolution, and frame rate independence, delivering multiple versions across various streaming outputs. 02 Built for IP TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) harnesses the might of IP connectivity for instant access to, and seamless interchange with unlimited IP sources from anywhere in the world, in real time. Native integration of NDI® supports video, audio and data transmission with minimal latency. 03 Effortless Power Supporting 44 video and 44 audio channel inputs, TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) offers is well equipped for cloud-ready vision mixing. Dynamic macro capabilities allow operators to deliver complex productions effortlessly, NDI Genlock guarantees consistent timing between cameras, and Alpha Channels can be sent through MIX outs, bringing post-production closer to live. 04 Operate from Anywhere Vizrt Control Panels operate TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) from any compatible device—remotely anywhere in the world. Handle remote video mixing, media playback, audio mixing, and macro automation, plus there’s also a panel builder tool to design custom panels geared toward unique productions and workflows. features Ready for Tomorrow’s Production Needs, Today Better Live Audio Multi-Program Output Remote Contribution Better Live Audio TriCaster® Vizion (Cloud) supports 44 audio channels and extends audio workflows though NDI, interconnecting with audio applications including Dante/AES 67 formats. Poor remote audio quality? Powered by Viz AI, Neural Voice Isolation uses AI to automatically detect voices and clean the audio so that remote callers can be clearly heard in loud environments. resource Get the Ultimate Guide to Cloud Live Production Deep dive into cloud and its place in the world of live content production. Understand the benefits of cloud workflows, what’s needed to “go cloud”, hardware and software equipment required. Download Now Case Studies Real-World Results with Vizrt “We no longer follow the model of one-to-many, where you transmit something and wait for feedback […] Now, you get the interaction immediately. This changes everything.” Fadi Radi Chief Creative Officer, blinx Fadi Radi Chief Creative Officer, blinx Read Case Study “We looked at just about every single vision mixer in the cloud and landed on TriCaster Vectar. It was important for us to have a solution that would reduce complexity and Vectar gave us better control options to build a completely virtualized production center.” Mike Buetsch Director of Broadcast Engineering and Production, Chess.com Mike Buetsch Director of Broadcast Engineering and Production, Chess.com Read Case Study \"Thanks to the exceptional supportive team at Vizrt, we’ve been able to overcome many challenges while training a brand-new team on such an advanced suite of products.\" John van de Molengraft Director of Broadcast Technology and Operations, tastylive John van de Molengraft Director of Broadcast Technology and Operations, tastylive Read Case Study FAQ Common Questions and Answers What is the TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) and who is it for? The TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) is a powerful and flexible 4K software-based live production system. Think of it as a complete TV studio in a box, but running as software, in the cloud. It’s designed for professional broadcasters, corporations, and educational institutions that need a high-quality, scalable solution for producing live video content. If you’re looking to create sophisticated live productions with multiple cameras, graphics, and video playback on a network-based infrastructure, TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) is the perfect tool to elevate your storytelling. How is the TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) different from a traditional hardware-based TriCaster? While both systems deliver the world-class production power TriCaster is known for, the main difference is where they are deployed. Traditional TriCasters are integrated hardware and software solutions—a single unit you plug in and use. TriCaster Vectar is a software-only solution deployed in the cloud. This provides incredible flexibility, allowing you to scale your production capabilities as your needs grow. It’s built for modern IP workflows and offers seamless integration with NDI® video-over-IP technology. Do I need to be a video expert to use the TriCaster Vizion (Cloud)? Not at all. While TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) is powerful enough for the most demanding broadcast environments, it features the same intuitive user interface that has made TriCaster systems famous. We provide a wealth of free training materials and tutorials to help you get started. The familiar layout, combined with powerful automation and macro capabilities, helps simplify complex operations. Whether you are an emerging content creator or a seasoned broadcast engineer, the TriCaster Vizion (Cloud) empowers you to create compelling live content with confidence. related products Run Your Next Broadcast with Better Confidence Viz Trio Viz Trio is built for speed, flexibility, and precision, helping operators manage, edit, and play out real-time graphics and video from a single, intuitive interface, from the control room or in the cloud. Learn more Viz Libero AI Po",
