      "id": "aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudml6cnQuY29tL3Byb2R1Y3RzL3RyaWNhc3Rlci90cmljYXN0ZXItbWluaS1z",
      "title": "TriCaster Mini S Our first software-only TriCaster deployable on hardware that works for you.",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.vizrt.com/products/tricaster/tricaster-mini-s/",
      "description": "TriCaster Mini S | Software-Only Live Production System | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Which TriCaster® is right for you? Take the Quiz Products Products TriCaster® Mini S TriCaster® Mini S You don’t have to be a video expert to tell your story with broadcast-quality results. TriCaster® Mini S, means you can make a show in resolutions up to UHD for delivery to any platform you want, within minutes of getting started. Try it Now Tech Specs Benefits Features FAQs Related Products Free Trial Benefits The Vizrt Advantage 01 Superior Accessibility TriCaster® Mini S offers users the choice of selecting their own hardware following our hardware requirements. In addition, choosing a Vizrt certified platform gives the user the optimal support experience with our Standard Support offering, making it the perfect way to start a journey with TriCaster®. 02 Supercharged Solution TriCaster Mini S includes a robust support package as part of the perpetual or subscription license, as well as guaranteed product updates as soon as they are released. TriCaster Graphics, powered by Viz Flowics Go Plan also comes as standard giving users industry leading graphics at their fingertips. 03 Sophisticated Production Built with NDI at its core, Mini S offers powerful 4Kp60 quality, perfect for streaming, podcasting, small corporate townhalls and live events. Equipped with 8 live inputs, 2 DDR players, 4 MEs, and vertical sessions all built in. Plus, many more sophisticated production features. Features Ready for Tomorrow’s Production Needs, Today Peace of Mind Packed with features Powerful Animated Graphics Peace of Mind Whether you choose a subscription or perpetual license, Mini S offers Support and maintenance and built in Viz Flowics to give you the peace of mind that your production is always in good hands. Certified Hardware Choose Your Hardware TriCaster® Mini S is Vizrt’s first software-only TriCaster®, designed to run on any hardware, with a curated list of Vizrt Certified devices that have been rigorously tested by its creators to guarantee optimal performance during critical production moments. Additionally, TriCaster® Mini S licenses include Vizrt Support, ensuring that any issues encountered are promptly addressed when using certified devices. Learn More FAQ Common Questions and Answers Find out all the essential details about our platform and how it can serve your needs. What is TriCaster® Mini S? TriCaster® Mini S is the first software-only TriCaster® available for downloadable trials and loading onto user-provided hardware. A trial version may be downloaded and run with a watermark on the outputs. A full license can be purchased through a Vizrt reseller. Is Mini S available for a one-time purchase or subscription? TriCaster® Mini S is available as both a one-time or a subscription purchase. This very first software-only TriCaster® is available for downloadable trials and loading onto user-provided hardware. A trial version may be downloaded and run with a watermark on the outputs. A full license can be purchased through a Vizrt reseller with a subscription or perpetual license. How does the user journey work? You can provide your information to apply for a trial below, once this has been completed, the software can be downloaded. This version can be installed on your hardware. Once installed, you will use the email provided activation code to launch and begin a 29-day trial. When you decide to fully license the product, you will contact a partner for license purchase. To find a certified reseller, use our reseller locator (Reseller Locator – Vizrt). You will receive a Welcome email, Support information email, and a Flowics subscription email to begin your storytelling. Related Products Run Your Next Broadcast with Better Confidence Control Panels There's no better way to harness the power of TriCaster® or Viz 3Play than with dedicated control panels built to offer optimal performance and the very best user experience. Learn more PTZ3 PLUS/UHD PLUS Connect, capture, and create beautiful live productions and presentations with two PTZ cameras built for BroadcastAV. Learn more Viz Connect Solo Effortlessly connecting any production, Viz Connect Solo video converters are the fastest, easiest, and best way to video over IP. Learn more Free Trial Try the Tricaster® Mini S for Free Why not take TriCaster® Mini S for a test drive? Simply click below and fill out your details and you will receive a 30-day trial of this powerful new software, we know you’ll love it! Try it Now Transform Viewer Experiences with Vizrt's Agentic AI Platform Put the AI already in our tools to work — captivate audiences, inspire action, redefine how the world connects with you. Talk to an Expert Explore Products Solutions Media & Entertainment Sports Enterprise Creator Economy Product Products Product Updates Component Updates Product Lifecycle Resources Case Studies Demos Events Webinars Documentation Center Viz University eBooks Blogs Partners Vizrt Partner Login Vizrt Partner Program Technical Partners Company NDI About Us Press Center Careers Sustainability Legal Center Sitemap Support Support Support Portal Reach us on Copyright ©2026 Vizrt. All rights reserved. Legal Center Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Modern Slavery",
