      "description": "Viz Libero | 3D Sports Analysis & Telestration Tool | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Products Products Viz Libero Viz Libero Boost replays with 3D advanced telestration and data-rich graphics. Viz Libero helps you give fans a deeper understanding of the game, and drive revenue with expanded reach and sponsorship across different distribution channels. Contact Sales Product Updates Benefits Features Case Studies Product Updates FAQs Related Products Resources Benefits The Vizrt Advantage 01 Turn Plays into Talking Points Highlight tactical brilliance and set-pieces with telestration, data-driven insights, hyper-realistic 3D camera flights and AR. Keep fans informed and entertained by explaining the ‘how’ and ‘why’ behind all the action. 02 Create Once, Publish Everywhere One platform. Multiple output formats. Produce explainer clips and use them across the live match (replays), studio shows, sponsored segments, digital platforms and social media. 03 Fast Turnaround, Minimal Crew Quickly generate expert-level highlight clips, even under tight deadlines, or during the match. Viz Libero’s straightforward interface makes creating clips fast and easy. 04 Maximize ROI On Your Sports Rights Extend the lifespan of your rights and create engaging analysis-augmented highlight clips, which younger viewers and sponsors love. Monetize across multiple platforms. And with Viz Libero’s value-based packages – you can customize and choose the features you want for your productions. 05 Cloud and Replay System Compatibility Supports cloud-based production, remote workflows, and integration with leading replay systems like EVS and Viz 3Play, ensuring flexibility and efficiency across platforms. Features Ready for Tomorrow’s Production Needs, Today Versatile telestration tools AI powered 3D Camera Flights Data Integration Immersive AR More than 70 Telestration Tools Supporting any sport, Viz Libero provides a versatile toolset to highlight player positions, show measurements, team tactics, and key moments. Unique to Viz Libero, you can also build custom tools. Resource Dive Into the Full Capabilities of Viz Libero Viz Libero is your ultimate playmaker for sports analysis. This turnkey solution delivers precise calibration, lightning-fast workflows, and cutting-edge features like data-driven graphics, AR, and virtual 3D visuals to take your coverage to the next level. Get the Solution Brief Case Studies Real-World Results with Vizrt Viz Libero allows us to pause the game, show what happened...It makes the experience more engaging for the viewer. Siddharth Sharma Head of Content Studios & Audience Engagement, Sports Siddharth Sharma Head of Content Studios & Audience Engagement, Sports Read Case Study “Our analysis clips helped us increase social media engagement by 78%.The feedback from fans has been incredible, and the numbers are off the scale in regards of views and interactions across various social media platforms.” Atle Rosseland Team Leader and Supervisor Performance Analysis, UEFA Atle Rosseland Team Leader and Supervisor Performance Analysis, UEFA Read Case Study “The 3D virtual flights are incredible. You can transition quickly between angles, show plays from different perspectives, and offer insights about player movement, distance, and the game’s nuances in a way that truly resonates with fans. Viz Libero elevates the storytelling experience.” Christian Thurley Associate Producer, Portland Trail Blazers Christian Thurley Associate Producer, Portland Trail Blazers Read Case Study Vizrt brought a new layer of value to our productions, in the way we engage and immerse the audience in the game. Even if fans are watching in a café and don’t hear me, they will still understand what happened from the analysis and graphics. Adrien Hadjialexandrou Lead Analyst, Cablenet Sports Adrien Hadjialexandrou Lead Analyst, Cablenet Sports Read Case Study Product Updates 