      "title": "Viz 3Play 3P2 Complete, 4k capable IP based live event production and replay system.",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.vizrt.com/products/3play/3p2/",
      "description": "Viz 3Play Vivid | 4K Sports Instant Replay System | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Products Products 3Play® Vivid 3Play® Vivid Powerful, intuitive instant replay for live sports and event production - helping operators capture, review, and present every key moment with speed and precision. Contact Sales Features Case Studies Tech Specs Related Products One Replay System. Complete Capability. Stop choosing between features. All the power of previous 3Play® generations unified in a single solution; 10-bit SDR/HDR workflows, ultra-high-definition capture, advanced playback, team collaboration, deployable on-prem or in the cloud. Your choice. All the power of previous 3Play generations unified in a single solution; 10-bit SDR/HDR workflows, ultra-high-definition capture, advanced playback, team collaboration, deployable on-prem or in the cloud. Your choice 8-input instant replay system with configurable SDI 10-bit SDR / HDR workflows Ultra-high-definition 2160p60 & end-to-end IP connectivity Shareable playlists for better team collaboration New 2RU common hardware platform shared across the family Compatible with current 3Play control panel 2RU Hardware | Cloud Built on one unified architecture Let's look at how 3Play® Vivid compares to its predecessors… All the power of previous 3Play® generations unified in a single solution; with even more to offer. Features 3Play® 3P1 3Play® 3P2 3Play® Vivid Input Count 4 8 8 SDI Input Max 4 4 6 Local Recording Channels (max) 4 8 8 Configurable l/O 12G SDI Support Max Session Resolution 1080p/60 4K/60 4K/60 LivePanel Playlist Sharing Playback Zoom & Tracking 10-bit Workflows HDR Workflows Control Panel Compatible Full of features that set you up to win.​ Intuitive Asset Management 3Play® Vivid is a 10-channel replay solution, and offering mix of 8 inputs via SDI and NDI. 3Play Vivid gives championship-level connection with any workflow. 10-Bit HDR Workflows Capture and replay every moment in full broadcast quality with expanded color depth and dynamic range, revealing details in highlights and shadows that 8-bit workflows miss. Future-proof your productions with HDR capability built in, ensuring your replays stay competitive with major network standards. Shareable Playlists 3Play® Vivid really is a team player, for the first time, it allows other 3Play and TriCaster® devices to access shareable playlists; operators can simply sync the entire playlists on the network which can be tagged with player names or numbers - offering unprecedented speed and flexibility across your workflow. Telestration Start telling the story from the first replay. With built-in NDI® Telestrator Pro technology, analysts, commentators, coaches, and scouts have the tools they need to annotate on screen and roll immediate replays from their connected devices. Rich visuals, responsive controls, and more-3Play® Vivid brings pro-style telestration to the studio, the sideline, and the film room for breaking-down plays, evaluating talent, game-planning for opponents, and explaining techniques. Playback Zoom & Tracking Give fans the best view of every critical and controversial plays-in real time, slow motion, or frame-by-frame. Quickly zoom in and out of replays to enrich the playback during live fast action games. 3Play® Vivid gives operators ultimate control to accurately scrub or step, frame by frame, through a replay for those mission critical calls and plays. Social Media Integration Take over timelines and feeds without leaving the live environment, sharing real-time highlights and screen captures directly from 3Play® Vivid to your social media accounts. Upload the best shots and clips to Facebook, X, YouTube, and more—complete with comments and hashtags—and provide instant updates for fans and followers on their computers and mobile devices. Intuitive Asset Management Exercise your clock management skills as you save valuable time logging, organizing, and retrieving content. From tagging events and clips with detailed metadata in a flash using your own custom coding system, to instantly filtering top plays by team, player, type, or period with the intelligent search engine, managing your assets with 3Play® Vivid is fast, efficient, at a fraction of the time typically required. Next Level Automation Experience new levels of efficiency and productivity with a comprehensive macro automation system that permits you to record, store, edit, and automate your favorite settings and custom command sequences. With the flexibility to run macros from any combination of compatible control interfaces and support for cross-platform automation, you can match your workflows to the available equipment and personnel at hand. Automatic Session Clean-Up 3Play® Vivid now offers operators the opportunity to manage their storage space by auto exporting marked clips, and when finished, delete unprotected sessions. This saves operators critical time and mitigate risk in production with intelligent drive management that runs behind the scenes. User Experience Keep your eye on the ball with fully adjustable single-screen or multi-screen monitoring. With a dedicated user interface display, two configurable multiviewers, selectable workspace layouts, customizable viewports, multi-angle replay preview windows, visual indicators, language localization, and more, you can easily personalize the 3Play® Vivid environment to your preferences Features Ready for Tomorrow’s Production Needs, Today Dual Channel Telestration IP & SDI Production LivePanel Compatibility Intuitive Asset Management Coverage and Capture Shareable Playlists Telestration Social Media Integration User Experience Dual Channel Telestration Enlighten and entertain audiences, enhancing play-by-play and analysis with live telestration, from the first replay. With NDI® Telestrator Pro technology, you can annotate on-screen and roll immediate replays over the network from any compatible",
