    {
      "id": "aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudml6cnQuY29tL3Byb2R1Y3RzL3Zpei1jb25uZWN0L3RldHJh",
      "title": "Viz Connect Tetra Seamlessly connects 12G SDI, 3G SDI, NDI® with built-in NDI® Bridge and Flowics HTML5 graphics",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.vizrt.com/products/viz-connect/tetra/",
      "description": "Viz Connect Tetra | 4K SDI/NDI Converter & Workstation | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales Products Products Viz Connect Tetra Viz Connect Tetra Viz Connect Tetra is an ultra-compact live production workstation that enables multi-channel 4K video and audio connectivity with a simple internet or network connection, anywhere in the world. Contact Sales Tech Specs Benefits Features FAQs Related Products Benefits The Vizrt Advantage 01 Viz Flowics meets NDI and Baseband Viz Connect Tetra – it seamlessly brings in graphics tools like Viz Flowics, converting them for use with SDI systems and of course the most popular live production systems around the world with NDI®. 02 Compact & Powerful Conversion Don’t let the desktop form factor of Viz Connect Tetra fool you – this adaptable box offers four flexible 12G IO channels, in an compact footprint that doesn’t have to live on a rack – unless of course, you need it to. 03 NDI at its Core Boasting access to NDI Bridge join-mode* in the device itself, this desktop converter can send and receive NDI for remote production anywhere in the world – without any additional hardware. 04 Our Most Flexible Audio Yet No matter the audio format you are using, Viz Connect Tetra has you covered – whether it’s NDI®, SDI, Dante, or ASIO – and for the very first time each IO channel supports 16×16 audio routing for patching on the go. features Ready for Tomorrow’s Production Needs, Today 4 Flexible I/O Channels 12G SDI Connectivity Viz Flowics NDI Bridge Audio Routing Viz Connect Family 4 Flexible I/O Channels For the first time in a Viz Connect product, 12G-SDI and 3G-SDI can be converted through NDI® High-Bandwidth with no compromise in each channel. resource Need More Technical Details? Check out our detailed technical specification document, for all the information you need. Tech Specs FAQ Common Questions & Answers Find out all the essential details about our platform and how it can serve your needs. What is Viz Connect Tetra, and what does it do? Viz Connect Tetra is a versatile connectivity solution designed to bridge IP and SDI workflows. It enables seamless integration of video and audio sources, offering flexibility for hybrid production environments. How does Viz Connect Tetra handle channel management? Channel management is made simple with Viz Connect Tetra, allowing control locally via integrated NDI KVM technology or remotely through a web-based API, ensuring efficient and adaptable workflows. Can Viz Connect Tetra integrate with existing SDI infrastructure? Yes, Viz Connect Tetra is designed to work with existing SDI equipment and infrastructure while providing IP flexibility, making it an ideal solution for hybrid setups. Related Products Where Creative Vision Meets Production Power TriCaster® Family AI Powered For two decades, TriCaster pioneered all-in-one live production. It helped build the modern broadcast workflow. It made professional production possible for thousands of organizations that previously had no realistic path to the tools and capabilities of major networks. We are proud that TriCaster now boasts a simpler, stronger and more sophisticated stable of products than ever before. Learn more Control Panels There's no better way to harness the power of TriCaster® or Viz 3Play than with dedicated control panels built to offer optimal performance and the very best user experience. Learn more Transform Viewer Experiences with Vizrt's Agentic AI Platform Put the AI already in our tools to work — captivate audiences, inspire action, redefine how the world connects with you. Talk to an Expert Explore Products Solutions Media & Entertainment Sports Enterprise Creator Economy Product Products Product Updates Component Updates Product Lifecycle Resources Case Studies Demos Events Webinars Documentation Center Viz University eBooks Blogs Partners Vizrt Partner Login Vizrt Partner Program Technical Partners Company NDI About Us Press Center Careers Sustainability Legal Center Sitemap Support Support Support Portal Reach us on Copyright ©2026 Vizrt. All rights reserved. Legal Center Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Modern Slavery",
