      "description": "Press Center | Vizrt | Transforming Viewer Experiences Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales All Resources Press Center Enterprise Customers & Partners +3 Vizrt reimagines live production workflows with fresh TriCaster portfolio Vizrt, the AI platform for visual storytelling, announces a complete refresh to its industry-leading live production tools, with brand new solutions TriCaster Vizion AI/R, 3Play Vivid, and TriCaster Prizm, as well as the LivePanel Pro feature. 10 September, 2026 Learn More Enterprise Product & Innovation + 2 Vizrt named a Leader in the 2026 IDC MarketScape Vizrt has been named a Leader in the 2026 IDC MarketScape for Worldwide AI-Driven Business Cycle in the Media Industry, recognizing its agentic AI platform for combining intelligent production orchestration with human editorial control. 11 September, 2026 Enterprise Customers & Partners + 3 Vizrt reimagines live production workflows with fresh TriCaster portfolio Vizrt, the AI platform for visual storytelling, announces a complete refresh to its industry-leading live production tools, with brand new solutions TriCaster Vizion AI/R, 3Play Vivid, and TriCaster Prizm, as well as the LivePanel Pro feature. 10 September, 2026 Enterprise Product & Innovation + 2 NDI and NVIDIA AI to Enable Real-time, AI-Powered Multilingual Content Production NDI and NVIDIA AI for Media enable broadcasters to create and distribute multilingual content in real time. The new workflow adapts a single media stream for multiple languages, reducing the infrastructure needed for multilingual production and distribution. 9 September, 2026 Enterprise Customers & Partners + 1 Omdia’s On The Radar: Vizrt’s Enterprise Communications Ambition Corporate communication has never mattered more. The challenge isn't reaching people—it's keeping their attention. Learn why organizations are placing greater focus on communication effectiveness and what it takes to make important messages more engaging, memorable and effective. 17 August, 2026 Sports Customers & Partners Vizrt graphics help Girraphic deliver exclusive MMA event in stadium and on Netflix When Netflix staged its debut MVP MMA event at the Intuit Dome in Los Angeles, Girraphic turned to Vizrt to deliver a seamless graphics experience across every screen. Using Viz Engine 5 and Viz Multiplay, the team delivered broadcast-grade graphics to the venue’s Halo Board and LED displays with a unified control workflow, creating engaging experiences for fans at the stadium and viewers watching live on Netflix. 5 August, 2026 Media & Entertainment Customers & Partners + 1 Vizrt strengthens its presence in the UK and Ireland with new distributor, Holdan Vizrt, the AI platform for visual storytelling, today announces a partnership with a new distributor based in the United Kingdom, Holdan, part of the Midwich Group. Holdan is licensed to distribute the full scope of Vizrt’s portfolio – from vision mixing and easy-to-use HTML5 graphics, to data-driven augmented reality (AR) graphics that creates virtual environments and powers in-depth analysis for live events and sports. 12 May, 2026 View More 6 from 106 Media & Partner Resources Access our official brand assets and communication guidelines to ensure consistent storytelling across all channels. Brand Assets Partner Guidelines Official Brand Guidelines Access the latest Vizrt brand standards, color palettes, and typography. Ensure all visual communications align with our 2026 identity. Download Brand Kit media enquiries Get in Touch with our Press Team For interview requests, media inquiries, or PR templates, reach out to our communications experts at [email protected] . Get in Touch Transform Viewer Experiences with Vizrt's Agentic AI Platform Put the AI already in our tools to work — captivate audiences, inspire action, redefine how the world connects with you. Talk to an Expert Explore Products Solutions Media & Entertainment Sports Enterprise Creator Economy Product Products Product Updates Component Updates Product Lifecycle Resources Case Studies Demos Events Webinars Documentation Center Viz University eBooks Blogs Partners Vizrt Partner Login Vizrt Partner Program Technical Partners Company NDI About Us Press Center Careers Sustainability Legal Center Sitemap Support Support Support Portal Reach us on Copyright ©2026 Vizrt. All rights reserved. Legal Center Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Modern Slavery",
