      "id": "aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudml6cnQuY29tL3ZpenJ0",
      "title": "About Vizrt",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.vizrt.com/vizrt/",
      "description": "About Vizrt - Real-Time Graphics & Live Production Software | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales All About us We're Transforming Viewer Experiences with Innovative Solutions Our Story Founded in 1997, Vizrt is a leading viewer engagement platform and a trusted expert in live production technologies for the Media & Entertainment, Sports, Enterprise, and Content Creator industries. Vizrt’s software-defined, cloud-ready and AI-integrated solutions are the foundation for a new era of storytelling, enabling creators to streamline workflows and enhance content delivery. It offers solutions for every component of live production, from real-time data-driven graphics and studio automation to intelligent media asset management and cloud-based productions. Vizrt, and its subsidiary NDI, employs over 600 people globally, enabling thousands of organizations worldwide, from colleges and corporates to the largest names in news and sports, to deliver visually immersive experiences to billions of people daily. Our Key Pillars Revolutionizing Viewer Experiences We deliver technology that turns ideas into unforgettable viewer experiences, making every moment meaningful and impactful. Empowering Storytellers Across Every Industry From broadcasters and sports leagues to enterprises and creators, we empower storytellers with tools that simplify workflows and amplify creativity A Platform Built for the Future With cloud, AI, and digital at the core, we empower creators to deliver efficient, unified, and engaging stories across platforms Innovation Through Partnership Your goals drive our innovation. Together, we deliver memorable outcomes, measurable impact, and ongoing success through collaboration Revolutionizing Viewer Experiences We deliver technology that turns ideas into unforgettable viewer experiences, making every moment meaningful and impactful. Empowering Storytellers Across Every Industry From broadcasters and sports leagues to enterprises and creators, we empower storytellers with tools that simplify workflows and amplify creativity A Platform Built for the Future With cloud, AI, and digital at the core, we empower creators to deliver efficient, unified, and engaging stories across platforms Innovation Through Partnership Your goals drive our innovation. Together, we deliver memorable outcomes, measurable impact, and ongoing success through collaboration metrics Shaping Experiences Globally 4.5bn+ People interact daily with media created using our tools 180+ Countries rely on our tools to engage diverse audiences 6600+ Customers Globally use Vizrt to engage their viewers 600+ Passionate people working to transform viewer experiences Board of Directors Klaus Holse Chairperson Klaus Holse has served as CEO of SimCorp, Corporate VP at Microsoft, and Senior VP at Oracle. His varied experience as a C-suite executive for large enterprise technology organizations will prove invaluable and help support Vizrt’s development plans. Klaus became chair of the board in 2022. Fredrik Näslund Director Fredrik Näslund has been with Nordic Capital for over 15 years and has been involved in 16 platform investments across the Technology and Payments and Healthcare sectors. Over the last fifteen years, Fredrik has devoted significant effort in building Nordic Capital’s position as the leading private equity investor in the Nordic mid-cap Technology and Payments sector. Lise Mortensen Director Lise Skaarup Mortensen is an accomplished Executive Director and Finance Leader with over 15 years of experience in the tech and biotech industries. Her professional scope and responsibilities range from finance functional leadership, IT Tech/Digital/Governance, and Business Development including Strategy and Mergers and Acquisitions. Philipp Krispin Board Member Philipp joined Nordic Capital in August 2022. Previously Philipp worked as Senior Investment Manager at EMH Partners from 2016 to 2022. Prior to that, he founded Castomaus.de, an online price comparison engine for promotional items, and worked at Golding Capital Partners. Philipp holds a Bachelor of Arts from Cologne Business School. He is based in Frankfurt. Executive Leadership Team Rohit Nagarajan Chief Executive Officer Rohit Nagarajan is a seasoned leader with over two decades of experience in the technology industry. As the CEO of Vizrt, his focus is on accelerating growth, further scaling Vizrt, enhancing customer offerings, and driving international expansion. Rohit has a proven track record of translating product innovation into positive business outcomes for customers and holds deep expertise across sales, marketing, and product management. He also has a strong ability to build culture and vision within an organization. Pierre Milet Chief Financial Officer Pierre has +30 years of experience working in finance senior executive positions. For the last four years, he worked as CFO at Infovista, a global Tech company. Prior experience includes working as both CFO and COO for Tech and Service companies with global footprints (Lucent, Avaya, CWT, One2Team). He started his career as auditor in one of the big four accountancy firms. He holds Master of Economics and Public law from Sciences Po Paris. Louise Bjerring Sabel Chief of Staff Louise is the Chief of Staff at Vizrt. Since joining the company in 2019, she has leveraged her strong experience in mergers and acquisitions and integrations and financial strategy from her previous career in the pharmaceutical industry. In this role, Louise has been instrumental in leading the PMO and enhancing operational efficiency, driving value creation throughout the organization. Her focus remains on aligning teams and strategies to support Vizrt’s goals and drive impactful growth. Ryan Poggi Chief Revenue Officer Ryan Poggi brings over 20 years of technology leadership experience, driving go-to-market growth across some of the fastest growing global markets. As Chief",
