      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.vizrt.com/our-future-vision/",
      "description": "Future Vision - Software-Defined Visual Storytelling | Vizrt Support Support Portal Product Updates Solutions Products Resources Partners Contact Sales All Sustainability Our Future Vision As a company we know that effective corporate sustainability is not just about building a future for our business, but also for our people, our customers, our communities, and our planet. Sustainability Report Product Impact partnerships Our Partnerships for Good We collaborate with charities and non-profits to amplify their impact through meaningful campaigns and innovative media solutions. Rise Mentoring Programme As part of our work with Rise, many employees take part in the organization’s mentoring schemes – both as mentors and mentees. Learn More Rise – Women In Broadcast Vizrt works closely with the membership organisation Rise – which champions gender diversity across the media technology sector. Projects include running workshops at their Rise Academy, as well as sponsoring the annual Rise Awards. Learn More Global Media & Entertainment Talent Manifesto As part of our Global CSR outreach in 2024 we are working closely with a project called the Global Media & Entertainment Talent. Learn More Our goal for corporate responsibility at Vizrt is to always lead from the front. Vizrt aims to inspire, to innovate, and to act for a better tomorrow. AD Anna Dahlfors Chief Human Resources Officer, Vizrt Global CSR Committee Each office has a local CSR team that reports into a Global committee to share best practice and inspiration. Each local team is responsible for initiatives that impact the local community, reduce the environmental impact of our offices, and raise money for charity. Food donation to local Swiss charity, Schweizer Tafel Bergen Beach Clean Up, 2023 Lake Pfäffikersee Clean Up Day in Switzerland Bergen Beach Clean Up, 2023 Bergen Beach Clean Up, 2022 Volunteering at Atlanta Science Festival, 2024 Features Here’s How We’re Working Towards a Greener Future From reducing emissions to conserving resources, these are some of the ways Vizrt is making a positive impact on the environment. Responsible Supply Chain Ethical sourcing and transparency across the entire supply chain Product Carbon Footprint Tracking emissions from production to end-of-life impact Sustainability Strategy From regulation to data-driven sustainability transformation Vizrt’s Sustainability Report 2025 Our 2025 report highlights our Sustainability Strategy and actions moving forward to increase our positive impact. Download Report Vizrt’s Sustainability Report 2024 Our 2024 report highlights the steps we’re taking to reduce impact, empower communities, and operate responsibly Download Report PCF Reports Learn more about the carbon impact of our products and download the full report. Explore Further Transform Viewer Experiences with Vizrt's Agentic AI Platform Put the AI already in our tools to work — captivate audiences, inspire action, redefine how the world connects with you. Talk to an Expert Explore Products Solutions Media & Entertainment Sports Enterprise Creator Economy Product Products Product Updates Component Updates Product Lifecycle Resources Case Studies Demos Events Webinars Documentation Center Viz University eBooks Blogs Partners Vizrt Partner Login Vizrt Partner Program Technical Partners Company NDI About Us Press Center Careers Sustainability Legal Center Sitemap Support Support Support Portal Reach us on Copyright ©2026 Vizrt. All rights reserved. Legal Center Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Modern Slavery",
