es. Our native connectors support financial data integration with broadcast graphics. ESPORTS Live game and tournament data. We partner with production companies and publishers to take Esports productions to the next level. ALL DATA WORKFLOWS Simplify the integration of external live data from different sources into your HTML5 broadcast graphics. CLOUD TO CLOUD Use Viz Data Connectors to populate your graphics with live data from different sources in the cloud. LOCAL TO CLOUD Use the data bridge to get live data from local sources into Viz Flowics in the cloud. CLOUD TO LOCAL Use the Flowics Middleware and Viz Data Connectors to push live data from the cloud to your local graphics systems. ALL GRAPHICS WORKFLOWS SUPPORTED DATA PROVIDERS + many more Do you need an integration not listed? Interested in partnering with us? Contact us! KEY FEATURES Support for Data Streaming & APIs Data Augmentations & Transformations Custom Translations and Internationalization No-Code Integration Manual or Automated Data Sync Easy Data Binding Looking to easily integrate live data into your HTML5 broadcast graphics? GET THE FREE TRIAL PLATFORM Overview Data Integrations Second Screen Add-On NRCS Integration Partners & Integrations TriCaster Graphics SOLUTIONS Sports Esports News Corporate & Government Entertainment Houses of Worship CUSTOMERS Who we work with RESOURCES Support Case Studies API Documentation Stream Deck Plugin Youtube Tutorials ABOUT VIZRT Thanks for visiting us! This site use cookies to improve your experience. I'm ok with this",
