      "description": "NDI – Removing the limits of video connectivity. Technology What is NDI? NDI 6.3 for Video for Audio for Metadata over WAN Using NDI Broadcast Live Events Corporate Large Installations Hybrid Education Content Creation ECOSYSTEM Product Finder NDI Certified Partners Camera Upgrades Advisory Board Tools Download NDI Tools for Windows for MacOS Plugins Mobile Apps Utilities Community Join us Training Forums Newsletter Resources Docs & Guides Stories Press Events Webinars User Support For Developers Become compatible with the NDI ecosystem. Learn more High efficiency, customization and certification. Learn more Unreal Engine SDK Download NDI Tools Removing the limits of video connectivity sharing collaboration creation optimization NDI connectivity technology enables thousands of products and organizations to create better multimedia experiences, more efficient setups, and unlock new AV use cases through IP. Download NDI Tools NDI 6.3 USE CASES One core technology, unlimited workflows. From world-class broadcast studios and leading systems integrators to home setups, NDI-based workflows are easy to install, cost-efficient, and unlock creative possibilities while delivering high performance in any context. Broadcast Transform traditional broadcast production into a fluid, IP-powered experience at a fraction of the cost and complexity of legacy systems. Learn more READ SUCCESS STORIES: NHL Blinx Live Events Quickly deliver local or global professional productions where every feed and graphic performs in perfect harmony. Learn more READ SUCCESS STORIES: Chess.com Activision Corporate Collaboration Transform meeting rooms and digital workspaces into multimedia hubs ready for collaboration in real-time. Learn more READ SUCCESS STORIES: Siemens UK Supreme Court Hybrid Education Merge in-person instruction with remote learning to bring classrooms into the digital age, empowering educators and inspiring students. Learn more READ SUCCESS STORIES: University of Arts London Harvard Large Installations Deploy infrastructures with hundreds of devices and turn large spaces into immersive experiences. Learn more READ SUCCESS STORIES: MSC Cruises MMG Events Content Creation Transform your home streaming setup into a professional-grade studio and enhance your content without the need for expensive gear. Learn more USE NDI WITH: OBS Studio Premiere Pro TECHNOLOGY NDI stands for Network Device Interface , a video connectivity standard that enables multimedia systems to identify and communicate with one another over IP and to encode, transmit, and receive high-quality, low latency, frame-accurate video and audio, and exchange metadata in real-time. Together with our growing ecosystem, we are developing the most efficient, easy-to-use, and interoperable technology for AV connections . High Efficiency We develop the most advanced video connectivity formats; and allow productions to scale without scaling costs. Plug & Play We guarantee that any NDI-enabled product is easy to operate, even without networking knowledge, and always works seamlessly. Interoperable We unlock complete connectivity with a growing ecosystem of NDI-enabled and compatible devices; and NDI is the only protocol you’ll need. Want to get technical? Read our White Paper CORE TECHNOLOGY The next step in IP connectivity. Learn more Learn more Learn more Learn more Learn more All the free tools and plugins you need to connect, stream and share your content. Windows MacOS Mobile Apps Utilities product ecosystem + 0 brands developing products with NDI Advanced + 0 k hardware products sold + 0 M unique software-based nodes Explore the NDI Product Finder FOR DEVELOPERS Future-proof your product's connectivity Join the fastest-growing product ecosystem in the industry and offer your users a plug-and-play experience. Test our SDKs and utilities to make your product: 1. Instantly discoverable in a standard IP network without requiring complex setups. 2. Able to send or receive high-quality, low-latency video, audio, controls, and metadata, all in the same stream. 3. Interoperable with an ecosystem of thousands of hardware and software products. NDI For Developers Join the Connected Community A platform to connect developers, systems integrators, resellers, thought leaders, and users. Level up your expertise with AVIXA-certified courses, participate in our forums, and access technical support. Join the community Courses Forums Support Ready to connect? Start connecting immediately and enter the future of real-time production. Download NDI Tools Product Finder Discover the perfect NDI-enabled products for your production needs. Explore Product Finder Want to know more about NDI 6.3 , our Core Technology Update? Read the full release notes in our Docs section Technology NDI 6.3 NDI for Video NDI for Audio NDI for Metadata NDI over WAN Ecosystem Product Finder Partners NDI Certified Camera Upgrades Advisory Board Tools NDI Tools Plugins Mobile Apps Utilities Community Join Us Courses Forums Newsletter Resources Docs & Guides Stories Press Events Webinars Support For Developers NDI SDK NDI Advanced NDI Unreal Engine SDK Linkedin Facebook-f Twitter Apple Spotify Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Product Security Careers Vizrt NDI AB ® 2026 Technology What is NDI? NDI 6.2 for Video for Audio for Metadata over WAN Using NDI Broadcast Live Events Corporate Large Installations Hybrid Education Content Creation ECOSYSTEM Product Finder NDI Certified Partners Camera Upgrades Tools Download NDI Tools for Windows for MacOS Plugins Mobile Apps Utilities Community Join us Training Forums Newsletter Resources Docs & Guides Stories Press Events Webinars User Support For Developers Become compatible with the NDI ecosystem. Learn more High efficiency, customization and certification. Learn more NDI SDK NDI Advanced Unreal Engine SDK Download NDI Tools Why is the NDI Professional Course a paid course? The NDI Professional Course is designed for professional